<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia Optus Vision to raise US$1bln - paper.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia Optus Vision to raise US$1bln - paper.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian pay-television and telecommunications operator Optus Vision plans to raise US$500 million on U.S. bond markets and up to another US$500 million in bank debt, The Australian Financial Review reported on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The money raised would be used to boost the pace of Optus Vision's optic fibre cable rollout around Australia, the Financial Review said.</p>
</text>
